{"id":"1v-lsd","name":"1V-LSD","form":"blotter","status":"Well-documented","aliases":"","category":"Psychedelic","chemicalClass":"Lysergamides","psychoactiveClass":"Psychedelic","addictionPotential":"non-addictive with a low abuse potential","toxicity":["extremely low toxicity relative to dose"],"summarySources":"PsychonautWiki","summary":"1V-LSD is a psychedelic substance belonging to the Lysergamides chemical class.","doseMaxTick":500,"doseUnit":"μg","doseRows":[{"roa":"Oral","source":"PsychonautWiki","unit":"μg","threshold":"15 μg","light":"25–75 μg","common":"75–150 μg","strong":"150–300 μg","heavy":"300 μg+","commonEstimate":113,"band":{"low":75,"high":150},"domain":[12,405],"segments":{"light":[25,75],"common":[75,150],"strong":[150,300],"heavy":[300,388.8]}}],"durationSources":"PsychonautWiki","durationRows":[{"roa":"Oral","onset":"20–60 min","comeup":"45–120 min","peak":"3–5 h","offset":"3–5 h","afterEffects":"6–24 h","total":"8–12 h"}],"tolerance":{"buildUp":"almost immediately after ingestion","reset":"14 days","milestones":[{"label":"Full tolerance","value":"almost immediately after ingestion","tone":"danger"},{"label":"Half tolerance","value":"5-7 days","tone":"warning"},{"label":"Baseline","value":"14 days","tone":"positive"}],"crossTolerances":[{"group":"Cross-tolerance","items":["Psychedelic"]}]},"subjectiveEffects":[],"combinations":[{"substance":"Lithium","status":"Dangerous","tone":"danger","note":"Documented dangerous interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Tramadol","status":"Unsafe","tone":"danger","note":"Documented unsafe interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Cannabis","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."},{"substance":"Stimulants","status":"Caution","tone":"warning","note":"Uncertain or unpredictable interaction on PsychonautWiki."}],"citations":[],"helpfulLinks":[{"title":"PsychonautWiki","description":"Pharmacology, subjective effects, and routes","url":"https://psychonautwiki.org/wiki/1V-LSD"},{"title":"Wikipedia","description":"Encyclopedia article","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1V-LSD"},{"title":"Wikidata","description":"Structured data on 1V-LSD","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q107479006"},{"title":"維基百科","description":"zh:Encyclopedia article","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/1V-LSD"}],"wikidata":"Q107479006","formula":"C25H33N3O2","molarMass":407.5,"pharmacology":{"text":"As demonstrated with other N-acylated derivatives of LSD, 1V-LSD is believed to serve as a prodrug for LSD but may also act directly as a weak partial agonist at the serotonin 5-HT2A receptor. A head-twitch response assay in mice found that 1V-LSD has a similar potency to 1P-LSD and 1cP-LSD, with behavioral effects also closely resembling these structural analogs.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"1V-LSD","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1V-LSD#Pharmacodynamics","kind":"Serotonergic psychedelic; Hallucinogen","figures":"1V-LSD"},"uses":{"text":"The drug has been encountered as a novel designer recreational drug.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"1V-LSD","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1V-LSD","routes":"Oral","figures":"1V-LSD"},"summaryZh":"1V-LSD（學名：1-戊醯基-D-麥角酸二乙醯胺）是一種有機化合物，化學式為C25H33N3O2。它是一種精神藥物及用於科研的迷幻藥物。它是天然麥角酸的人工合成的衍生物，是LSD的結構類似物。它從2022年起被德國管制，2024年7月1日起被中華人民共和國管制。"}